<p>
Python ek high-level, interpreted programming language hai jo is tarah design ki gayi hai ki insaan ke liye padhna aur likhna easy ho aur computer ke liye samajhna bhi efficient ho. Isse Guido van Rossum ne 1991 me develop kiya tha. Python ka main focus simplicity aur readability hai, isliye iska syntax bilkul English jaisa lagta hai. Isi wajah se beginners ke liye ye sabse popular languages me se ek hai.

Python ko “interpreted language” kaha jata hai, iska matlab hai ki code line by line execute hota hai, bina compile kiye. Isse development fast ho jata hai aur debugging bhi easy hoti hai. Python dynamically typed language hai, yani tumhe variable ka type pehle se declare nahi karna padta. Jaise hi tum value assign karte ho, Python khud samajh leta hai ki wo integer hai, string hai ya kuch aur.

Is language ka use bahut wide hai. Web development me Python ka use backend banane ke liye hota hai, jahan se data handle hota hai aur logic execute hota hai. Data analysis ke field me Python bahut powerful hai kyunki isme Pandas aur NumPy jaise libraries available hai jo large data ko easily process kar sakte hai. Artificial Intelligence aur Machine Learning me bhi Python ka bahut bada role hai, jahan par TensorFlow aur Scikit-learn jaise tools use hote hai models banane ke liye. Iske alawa Python automation ke liye bhi use hota hai, jaise repetitive tasks ko automatically perform karna.

Python ka ek aur important feature hai iska huge ecosystem. Isme hazaron libraries aur frameworks available hai jo developer ka kaam easy bana dete hai. Django aur Flask jaise frameworks web applications banane me help karte hai. Python cross-platform bhi hai, matlab ek hi code Windows, Linux aur Mac sab par run ho sakta hai.

Agar career ke perspective se dekha jaye to Python ek high-demand skill hai. Companies Python developers, data analysts, data scientists aur automation engineers hire kar rahi hai. Freshers ke liye bhi ye ek strong option hai kyunki isse seekhna relatively easy hai aur isme projects bana kar job ke chances badh jate hai.
</p>

